@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam ParticipantPadding 24
skinparam BoxPadding 12
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #42566B
  LifeLineBorderColor #8295A8
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #D8EAFE
  ActivationBorderColor #42566B
  ParticipantBorderColor #42566B
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #E8F1FA
  ParticipantFontColor #172B4D
  ActorBorderColor #42566B
  ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  GroupBorderColor #8295A8
  GroupBackgroundColor #F4F7FA
  GroupHeaderFontColor #172B4D
  DividerBackgroundColor #E8F1FA
  DividerBorderColor #8295A8
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFBEB
  BorderColor #BBA86A
  FontSize 12
}
hide footbox
title UC-P03 - View My Parking and Charging Bookings
actor Student as ST
boundary "Student Portal" as UI
control "Booking Query Service" as SVC
entity "Mobility Records" as DATA

note over ST,DATA
  Preconditions: Student is signed in; existing bookings are not required.
  Service calls use the signed-in Student's identity.
end note

ST -> UI: Open My Parking and Charging Bookings
activate UI #D8EAFE
UI -> SVC: Get my bookings (filter)
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC -> SVC: Verify current session
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC --> SVC: Session valid / expired
deactivate SVC
alt session expired
SVC -> SVC: Prepare authentication-required result
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC --> SVC: No personal data retrieved
deactivate SVC
else session valid
SVC -> DATA: Find reservations, sessions and charging requests owned by studentId
activate DATA #E2E7ED
DATA --> SVC: Matching records / empty result / retrieval error
deactivate DATA
end
SVC --> UI: List result or access / retrieval error
deactivate SVC
alt session expired
UI --> ST: Sign in before reloading; do not reveal personal data
else session valid but retrieval failed
UI --> ST: Report read error, not no bookings; retained data is not refreshed
else query succeeded with no matches
UI --> ST: Show valid empty state; leave or start a separate use case
else query succeeded with matching records
UI --> ST: Show Hub, vehicle, intervals, statuses and existing charging allocations
end
deactivate UI
break session expired, retrieval failed or no matching records
note over ST,DATA
  End this list query. Authentication, retry, filter changes or new use cases are separate attempts.
end note
end
ST -> UI: Open a record, change filter / refresh, or close
activate UI #D8EAFE
alt Student changes filter, refreshes or closes
UI --> ST: Start a fresh list query, or close without changes
else Student selects a record
UI -> SVC: Get current owned details (recordRef)
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC -> SVC: Recheck current session
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC --> SVC: Session valid / expired
deactivate SVC
opt session valid
SVC -> DATA: Find owned record and latest linked parking / charging details
activate DATA #E2E7ED
DATA --> SVC: Current details / missing or inaccessible / retrieval error
deactivate DATA
opt current owned details retrieved
SVC -> SVC: Derive permitted actions from current state
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC --> SVC: Current actions; Active charging cannot use UC-P05
deactivate SVC
end
end
SVC --> UI: Current details and actions / access or retrieval error
deactivate SVC
alt session expired
UI --> ST: Sign in before reloading; do not reveal details
else record missing or inaccessible
UI --> ST: Generic unavailable message; return to refreshed owned-record list
else retrieval failed
UI --> ST: Offer retry; mark retained details as not refreshed
else current owned details retrieved
UI --> ST: Show latest details and actions; distinguish Pending, Scheduled and Active
end
end
deactivate UI
note over ST,DATA
  Returning to the list or refreshing starts a new query with current access checks.
  A request that has become Active cannot be cancelled through UC-P05.
  Read-only: no booking, session, request or allocation changes.
end note

legend bottom left
  Thin rectangle: execution of a responsibility; nested rectangle: nested execution
  Solid arrow: request / action   |   Dashed arrow: returned result
  Activation ends before waiting for Student input. Read guards top to bottom.
  critical: required consistency boundary; updates are all-or-none as noted
endlegend
footer Smart E-Mobility Hub | Submission 2 | Parking & Private EVs
@enduml
